('TRGG-GUEST-1184', 'Pettersson, Pelle', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Phone booking at Bangpakong Riverside = guesswork', 'Every time I call Bangpakong Riverside for a caddy it''s a guessing game whether they understood. On 14 Sep I turned up and they had me down for a different day. Not blaming the staff, but the process is hopeless. I''ve put it in the group chat as well.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'urgent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-16 12:49:21+07', '2026-09-16 12:49:21+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0053', 'Baek, Yoon-Seuk', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Eastern Star caddy line - English please', 'The person answering the caddy phone at Eastern Star kept saying ''no have'' when I asked about 17 Sep, and I still don''t know if that means no caddies, no booking, or no idea what I said. Very frustrating.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-16 10:58:12+07', '2026-09-16 10:58:12+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0675', 'McEwan, John', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong caddy line - English please', 'The person answering the caddy phone at Bangpakong kept saying ''no have'' when I asked about 20 Sep, and I still don''t know if that means no caddies, no booking, or no idea what I said. Very frustrating. Happy to talk to someone about it.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-16 07:33:22+07', '2026-09-16 07:33:22+07'),
('Ud64cab442243571e125e1b94e2006175', 'Andersson, Niklas', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong - ''no caddy'' again', 'Second week running Bangpakong says no caddies for our group, this time for 18 Sep. We''ve played there for years. Is it the busloads of tour groups? Can anything be done through the app?', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-16 07:23:19+07', '2026-09-16 07:23:19+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0395', 'Hill, DeHaven', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong - phone rings out', 'Can the app help with this? I''ve been trying to book a caddy at Bangpakong for our 16 Sep game. The line either rings out or goes engaged. I gave up after 6 attempts. Bangpakong used to be fine for caddies. Something has changed.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 20:29:09+07', '2026-09-15 20:29:09+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0994', 'Terrell, Lindsay', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Gave up trying to book at Bangpakong', 'Spent most of Monday trying to book caddies at Bangpakong for our group on 17 Sep. Between the phone not being answered and nobody understanding, I gave up. We''ll take whoever is standing there. Everyone I''ve spoken to this week has the same story about Bangpakong.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 20:25:40+07', '2026-09-15 20:25:40+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0690', 'Mehta, Suresh', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong caddy booking needs fixing', 'The app tells me to phone Bangpakong to book a caddy for 17 Sep. I did. 14 times. This is 2026, surely the course can take a booking through the app like the tee time? Bangpakong used to be fine for caddies. Something has changed.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 20:14:49+07', '2026-09-15 20:14:49+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0331', 'Gordon, Tyson', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Told to just turn up and wait at Pattaya CC', 'Pattaya CC won''t take a caddy booking for 18 Sep. ''Come at 6, wait, maybe have.'' We come from Pattaya, that''s an hour each way on a maybe. Not good enough.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 19:18:56+07', '2026-09-15 19:18:56+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0166', 'Choi, Jae-Myong', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Language problem booking at Bangpakong Riverside', 'Got through to Bangpakong Riverside to book a caddy for 20 Sep but the lady on the phone couldn''t understand me and I couldn''t understand her. Ended up hanging up with nothing booked. My Thai isn''t good enough for this.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 18:52:40+07', '2026-09-15 18:52:40+07'),
('U68d252ed72808f46e96056d723c62a21', 'Paul Anderson', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong Riverside short of caddies every weekend', 'Is there any way for the app to show which courses actually have caddies? Bangpakong Riverside has been short every Friday this month, and they''ve just said no again for 18 Sep. We''d rather know before driving out.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'high', 'Asked the course for a LINE contact for bookings. Sent it to the reporter.', '2026-09-16 10:27:25+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 18:29:25+07', '2026-09-16 10:27:25+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0027', 'Annand, Guy', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong Riverside - ''no caddy'' again', 'Second week running Bangpakong Riverside says no caddies for our group, this time for 18 Sep. We''ve played there for years. Is it the busloads of tour groups? Can anything be done through the app? Our whole group feels the same.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', 'Reporter played with a walk-up caddy. Nothing more to do.', '2026-09-16 07:33:09+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 18:20:32+07', '2026-09-16 07:43:09+07'),
('KAKAO-5005027919', '장인열', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '방파콩 리버사이드 캐디 데스크 무응답', '월요일부터 방파콩 리버사이드 캐디 데스크에 전화하는데 계속 받지 않습니다. 9월 17일 라운드입니다. 앱에서 대신 연락해 주실 수 있나요?', NULL, 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 14:38:02+07', '2026-09-15 14:38:02+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-1082', 'Yang-Kim, Tae', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong caddy line - English please', 'The person answering the caddy phone at Bangpakong kept saying ''no have'' when I asked about 17 Sep, and I still don''t know if that means no caddies, no booking, or no idea what I said. Very frustrating. We''ll play elsewhere if this carries on. Everyone I''ve spoken to this week has the same story about Bangpakong.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 14:22:06+07', '2026-09-15 14:22:06+07'),
('GOOGLE-112062616158452388613', '정용철', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '그린밸리 전화 예약 의사소통 문제', '그린밸리에 캐디 예약 전화를 했는데 영어도 한국어도 안 통해서 예약이 됐는지 모르겠습니다. 9월 16일 10:00 4명입니다. 확인 부탁드립니다. 골프장에 전달 부탁드립니다.', NULL, 'in_progress', 'normal', 'Collecting these to send to the course together.', NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 14:01:53+07', '2026-09-16 07:36:02+07'),
('GOOGLE-112062616158452388613', '정용철', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '방파콩 리버사이드 예약해도 캐디 없음', '방파콩 리버사이드에 9월 15일 캐디 2명 예약했는데 당일 캐디가 없었고 예약 기록도 없다고 했습니다.', NULL, 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 13:43:44+07', '2026-09-15 13:43:44+07'),
('KAKAO-5080228739', '피에프', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '방파콩 캐디 예약 절차 불편', '방파콩 캐디 예약하려면 프로샵, 캐디 마스터, 다시 프로샵… 계속 돌려보냅니다. 9월 17일 10:30 티타임 캐디 확인이 안 됩니다. 골프장에 전달 부탁드립니다.', NULL, 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-15 09:52:45+07', '2026-09-15 09:52:45+07'),
('KAKAO-5002920885', '타이거', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '방파콩 캐디 데스크 무응답', '토요일부터 방파콩 캐디 데스크에 전화하는데 계속 받지 않습니다. 9월 18일 라운드입니다. 앱에서 대신 연락해 주실 수 있나요? 골프장에 전달 부탁드립니다.', NULL, 'resolved', 'high', 'Asked the course for a LINE contact for bookings. Sent it to the reporter.', '2026-09-16 10:56:58+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 21:48:11+07', '2026-09-16 11:08:58+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0772', 'Opic, Brittany', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Language problem booking at Bangpakong Riverside', 'Got through to Bangpakong Riverside to book a caddy for 17 Sep but the lady on the phone couldn''t understand me and I couldn''t understand her. Ended up hanging up with nothing booked. My Thai isn''t good enough for this. I''ve put it in the group chat as well.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 21:14:32+07', '2026-09-14 21:14:32+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0916', 'Sig, Jonas', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong Riverside can''t understand the caddy request', 'My wife and I both tried calling Bangpakong Riverside. Neither of us could get past ''what time''. We said 7:10 on 15 Sep three times. They hung up. Is there a LINE account we can type to instead? I''ve put it in the group chat as well.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 20:10:28+07', '2026-09-14 20:10:28+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0407', 'Hollman, Trevor', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'No way to reach Bangpakong for a caddy', 'Honestly the booking process at Bangpakong is broken. Phone unanswered for two days. I just want caddy 111 again for 15 Sep, she was great last time.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 18:00:54+07', '2026-09-14 18:00:54+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0331', 'Gordon, Tyson', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong Riverside - please put caddy booking in the app', 'Can MyCaddiPro take caddy bookings for Bangpakong Riverside? The phone process is hopeless - took me 6 calls over two days to book for 18 Sep and I still don''t have a caddy number. Same as the last few weeks there, it''s getting worse.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 17:19:02+07', '2026-09-14 17:19:02+07'),
('Ub115b73ccf87cacbab030128c9ed8247', 'Patrik Andersson', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddies run out by 9am at Rayong Green Valley', 'Rayong Green Valley said they had caddies when I called. Got there for our 13:20 time on 14 Sep and they''d all gone out with the earlier groups. Nobody thought to hold one for the booking. Our whole group feels the same.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'in_progress', 'normal', 'Asked the reporter which caddy number was booked.', NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 15:38:21+07', '2026-09-16 07:55:54+07'),
('Ud6ad7cf92502b449c38538cf358b21d6', 'Erik Lundman', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'No way to reach Bangpakong for a caddy', 'Honestly the booking process at Bangpakong is broken. Phone unanswered for two days. I just want caddy 63 again for 20 Sep, she was great last time. Please pass this on to the course.', 'JGTS', 'open', 'urgent', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-14 10:30:21+07', '2026-09-14 10:30:21+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0237', 'Donis, Danny', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong only had one caddy for four of us', 'Turned up at Bangpakong on 12 Sep having phoned ahead and they had ONE caddy for our fourball. Told the rest of us to carry. Booking ahead means nothing there. Our whole group feels the same.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'in_progress', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-13 17:32:35+07', '2026-09-15 08:56:01+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0845', 'Pullinen, Jyrki', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong - couldn''t make myself understood', 'Rang Bangpakong caddy master. I said caddy, 14 Sep, 7:50, four players. She said ''yes yes'' then asked me something in Thai I couldn''t follow and it went nowhere. Is there anyone there who speaks English?', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'in_progress', 'normal', 'Waiting on the course to call back.', NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-13 16:10:16+07', '2026-09-13 17:41:55+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0994', 'Terrell, Lindsay', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddy desk at Eastern Star not answering', 'Called Eastern Star caddy desk Saturday morning and again in the afternoon for our 14 Sep game. Nobody there. The pro shop said ''call caddy master'' and gave me the same number. Going round in circles. We''ll play elsewhere if this carries on.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'in_progress', 'normal', 'Trying the caddy desk again in the morning.', NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-13 12:52:18+07', '2026-09-14 16:28:07+07'),
('GOOGLE-106057425792037413929', 'Joe Ryder', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Can''t confirm my caddy at Bangpakong Riverside', 'I think I have a caddy booked at Bangpakong Riverside for 15 Sep but I can''t get anyone to confirm it. No booking reference, no message, nothing. The whole thing runs on hope. Same as the last few weeks there, it''s getting worse.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'in_progress', 'normal', 'Collecting these to send to the course together.', NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-13 11:51:33+07', '2026-09-15 02:17:16+07'),
('KAKAO-4911042963', '파타야 조아골프(강동주)', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '로얄 레이크사이드 캐디 예약 절차 불편', '로얄 레이크사이드 캐디 예약하려면 프로샵, 캐디 마스터, 다시 프로샵… 계속 돌려보냅니다. 9월 15일 7:30 티타임 캐디 확인이 안 됩니다. 골프장에 전달 부탁드립니다. 저희 조 모두 같은 생각입니다.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-13 10:59:47+07', '2026-09-13 10:59:47+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0608', 'Lee, Mr', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Booking a caddy at Bangpakong is too hard', 'Why is booking a caddy at Bangpakong so difficult? Phone only, phone rarely answered, no English, no confirmation. Every other part of the round I can do in the app. Please add caddy booking for Bangpakong. Same as the last few weeks there, it''s getting worse.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'high', 'Asked the course for a LINE contact for bookings. Sent it to the reporter.', '2026-09-13 11:24:36+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-13 08:04:12+07', '2026-09-13 11:39:36+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0324', 'Godsell, Bill', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong Riverside can''t understand the caddy request', 'My wife and I both tried calling Bangpakong Riverside. Neither of us could get past ''what time''. We said 10:30 on 16 Sep three times. They hung up. Is there a LINE account we can type to instead? Happy to talk to someone about it.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-12 21:05:54+07', '2026-09-12 21:05:54+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-1181', 'Petersen, George', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Pattaya CC caddy no-show, second time', 'Second time in two weeks my booked caddy at Pattaya CC hasn''t shown up. First on 2 Sep, again on 10 Sep. I''m done booking there by phone, it clearly isn''t written down anywhere.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-09-12 19:05:55+07', '2026-09-12 19:05:55+07'),
