('MANUAL-1787279354491-zdr0rd1', 'Hirai Nobuyoshi', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Royal Lakeside no-show caddy, no apology', 'Our group had three caddies booked at Royal Lakeside on 23 Aug. One turned up. The other two just didn''t appear and nobody at the course seemed to care. We paid the caddy fee up front too.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-29 01:54:29+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-26 21:13:16+07', '2026-08-29 01:54:29+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0800', 'Pata, M J', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Royal Lakeside no-show caddy, no apology', 'Our group had three caddies booked at Royal Lakeside on 24 Aug. One turned up. The other two just didn''t appear and nobody at the course seemed to care. We paid the caddy fee up front too. This is the third time I''m raising it.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'low', NULL, '2026-08-28 01:11:26+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-26 20:46:21+07', '2026-08-28 01:11:26+07'),
('U50ec4f184eb9e5cd8710a26ef6d251cc', 'Facey, Alex', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'No caddies available at Pattaya Country Club', 'Called Pattaya Country Club for 27 Aug and was told no caddies available. It''s a Thursday. How can a course have no caddies on a Thursday? We''re four players. We''ll play elsewhere if this carries on.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'high', 'Confirmed the booking directly with the caddy master and messaged the reporter.', '2026-08-26 15:20:27+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-26 08:04:38+07', '2026-08-26 15:30:27+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0625', 'Lombardi, Lou', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Bangpakong - couldn''t make myself understood', 'Rang Bangpakong caddy master. I said caddy, 30 Aug, 8:30, four players. She said ''yes yes'' then asked me something in Thai I couldn''t follow and it went nowhere. Is there anyone there who speaks English?', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'in_progress', 'high', 'Trying the caddy desk again in the morning.', NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-25 21:44:13+07', '2026-08-26 04:40:24+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0378', 'Hatfield, Tim', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Gave up trying to book at Green Valley', 'Spent most of Monday trying to book caddies at Green Valley for our group on 28 Aug. Between the phone not being answered and nobody understanding, I gave up. We''ll take whoever is standing there.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-28 08:21:15+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-25 20:55:33+07', '2026-08-28 08:21:15+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-1186', 'Phillips, Patrick', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddy 54 at Bangpakong Riverside - booked, not there', 'I specifically asked for caddy 54 at Bangpakong Riverside on 23 Aug, confirmed by phone twice. On the day she was out with another group. They gave me a girl who''d started that week. What''s the point of booking? Our whole group feels the same.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'high', 'Passed to the course. They apologised and refunded the caddy fee.', '2026-08-28 16:10:34+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-25 17:57:52+07', '2026-08-28 16:22:34+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0979', 'Symons, Luck', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddy desk at Bangpakong not answering', 'Called Bangpakong caddy desk Monday morning and again in the afternoon for our 27 Aug game. Nobody there. The pro shop said ''call caddy master'' and gave me the same number. Going round in circles.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-26 20:28:04+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-25 12:46:44+07', '2026-08-26 20:28:04+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0314', 'Gee, Ariel', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Royal Lakeside caddy booking needs fixing', 'The app tells me to phone Royal Lakeside to book a caddy for 29 Aug. I did. 8 times. This is 2026, surely the course can take a booking through the app like the tee time?', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-24 22:44:16+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-24 16:29:43+07', '2026-08-24 22:44:16+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0298', 'Frendberg, Thomas', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Booking a caddy at Rayong Green Valley is too hard', 'Why is booking a caddy at Rayong Green Valley so difficult? Phone only, phone rarely answered, no English, no confirmation. Every other part of the round I can do in the app. Please add caddy booking for Rayong Green Valley. I''ve put it in the group chat as well.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'high', NULL, '2026-08-24 17:47:01+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-24 10:47:16+07', '2026-08-24 17:47:01+07'),
