('U8cef611e6ddcbe766edeb1b30eca7edf', 'Tony Cliff', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Booking a caddy at Eastern Star is impossible by phone', 'We play Eastern Star every couple of weeks and every time it''s the same. Phone unanswered. Turn up on the day and hope. Please put their caddy booking in the app. Please pass this on to the course.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-20 12:15:42+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-20 07:58:21+07', '2026-08-20 12:15:42+07'),
