('TRGG-GUEST-1169', 'Moen, Gaute', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddies run out by 9am at Pattaya Country Club', 'Pattaya Country Club said they had caddies when I called. Got there for our 10:40 time on 11 Aug and they''d all gone out with the earlier groups. Nobody thought to hold one for the booking. Please pass this on to the course.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', 'Course says they were short on the day. Told the reporter.', '2026-08-14 03:16:58+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-13 18:49:22+07', '2026-08-14 03:30:58+07'),
('Ucbf0bcd3bbfb1827f9902589d68e2d44', 'Shilling, Tim', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Too many hoops to book a caddy at Bangpakong Riverside', 'Booking a caddy at Bangpakong Riverside for 15 Aug: no online option, phone unreliable, and when you do get through they want you to call back the day before to ''confirm''. Then they still don''t have your name.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'low', NULL, '2026-08-14 21:26:54+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-13 09:57:19+07', '2026-08-14 21:26:54+07'),
('KAKAO-5002920885', '타이거', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '파타야 CC 캐디 데스크 무응답', '화요일부터 파타야 CC 캐디 데스크에 전화하는데 계속 받지 않습니다. 8월 17일 라운드입니다. 앱에서 대신 연락해 주실 수 있나요? 저희 조 모두 같은 생각입니다.', NULL, 'resolved', 'normal', 'Spoke to the caddy desk on the reporter''s behalf. Booking now in their book.', '2026-08-14 03:06:52+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-13 08:37:57+07', '2026-08-14 03:08:52+07'),
('U657c6033b696a24ed75b16158ea4f535', '김경태 (Kyungtae Kim)', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '방파콩 캐디 노쇼', '방파콩에서 8월 12일 8:40에 예약한 캐디 20번이 안 나왔습니다. 대체 캐디도 없었어요. 예약이 의미가 없습니다. 여러 번 말씀드린 내용입니다.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'resolved', 'high', NULL, '2026-08-14 12:30:10+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-12 18:46:25+07', '2026-08-14 12:30:10+07'),
('MANUAL-1789034788824-hhdj32c', 'Nicholas Malakari', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Rayong Green Valley caddy booking phone never picked up', 'Tried the caddy booking number for Rayong Green Valley on and off all day. No answer. Then someone picked up at 4pm and told me to call back tomorrow. For a tee time on 16 Aug.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'high', 'Asked the course for a LINE contact for bookings. Sent it to the reporter.', '2026-08-11 06:38:04+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-10 18:57:19+07', '2026-08-11 06:44:04+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0658', 'Matsumoto, Shozo', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Eastern Star caddy booking needs fixing', 'The app tells me to phone Eastern Star to book a caddy for 11 Aug. I did. 11 times. This is 2026, surely the course can take a booking through the app like the tee time? Our whole group feels the same.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-10 22:34:29+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-10 17:41:12+07', '2026-08-10 22:34:29+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-1181', 'Petersen, George', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Nobody answers the caddy line at Bangpakong', 'Rang Bangpakong 6 times Friday between 9 and 11 to book a caddy for 12 Aug. It just rings out. There''s no voicemail, no LINE, nothing. How are we meant to book?', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-09 20:43:56+07', '2026-08-09 20:43:56+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0437', 'Inggall, Kenny', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddy didn''t show at Pattaya CC', 'Booked caddy 11 at Pattaya CC for 7 Aug at 8:20. She never came. The caddy master said she had ''gone home''. No replacement. We teed off without a caddy on a course I don''t know. Please pass this on to the course.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'high', NULL, '2026-08-10 23:26:38+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-08 20:36:42+07', '2026-08-10 23:26:38+07'),
('KAKAO-5002920885', '타이거', 'ko', 'caddy_booking', '이스턴 스타 전화 연결이 안 돼요', '이스턴 스타 캐디 마스터 번호로 계속 전화하는데 연결이 안 됩니다. 8월 8일 13:40 티타임인데 캐디 예약을 못 하고 있습니다.', NULL, 'resolved', 'normal', 'Reporter played with a walk-up caddy. Nothing more to do.', '2026-08-07 21:26:59+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-07 19:54:27+07', '2026-08-07 21:36:59+07'),
('Ua9f183348f7e0287568cb2235d2d9776', 'Lee Floro', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Gave up trying to book at Pattaya CC', 'Spent most of Monday trying to book caddies at Pattaya CC for our group on 10 Aug. Between the phone not being answered and nobody understanding, I gave up. We''ll take whoever is standing there.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-08 01:15:24+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-05 19:18:57+07', '2026-08-08 01:15:24+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0777', 'Ottaway, Daryl', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Can''t confirm my caddy at Rayong Green Valley', 'I think I have a caddy booked at Rayong Green Valley for 9 Aug but I can''t get anyone to confirm it. No booking reference, no message, nothing. The whole thing runs on hope.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'low', NULL, '2026-08-08 15:53:55+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-05 17:23:30+07', '2026-08-08 15:53:55+07'),
('GOOGLE-110807204760125729126', 'Tony FUNG', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Royal Lakeside - simplest thing made hard', 'All I want is to book caddy 13 at Royal Lakeside for 7:40 on 6 Aug. Phone, LINE, in person - none of it works reliably. Please talk to them about taking bookings through MyCaddiPro.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'low', NULL, '2026-08-06 03:39:15+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-05 15:27:37+07', '2026-08-06 03:39:15+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0589', 'Larsen, Bent', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Too many hoops to book a caddy at Bangpakong', 'Booking a caddy at Bangpakong for 8 Aug: no online option, phone unreliable, and when you do get through they want you to call back the day before to ''confirm''. Then they still don''t have your name.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'high', 'Passed to the course. They say bookings by phone only, 7:00 to 16:00.', '2026-08-07 11:46:54+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-05 10:45:32+07', '2026-08-07 12:05:54+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0866', 'Richards, Martin', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Booked and still no caddy at Bangpakong Riverside', 'Booked two caddies at Bangpakong Riverside for 3 Aug by phone, got a ''yes''. Arrived: no caddies, no record of the call. The caddy master shrugged. Please help. Our whole group feels the same.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-07 18:43:18+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-04 21:28:35+07', '2026-08-07 18:43:18+07'),
('U8cef611e6ddcbe766edeb1b30eca7edf', 'Tony Cliff', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddies for the Travellers Rest day at Bangpakong Riverside', 'We''re four in the Travellers Rest game at Bangpakong Riverside on 5 Aug, first tee 9:45. Three days of calling the caddy line and not one answer. Can MyCaddiPro get through to them? I''ve put it in the group chat as well.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'normal', NULL, '2026-08-04 21:59:03+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-04 20:04:22+07', '2026-08-04 21:59:03+07'),
('Uf2f379478537b232421624e3cf5e5fab', 'Thurburn, Matt', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Caddy 20 at Bangpakong Riverside - booked, not there', 'I specifically asked for caddy 20 at Bangpakong Riverside on 1 Aug, confirmed by phone twice. On the day she was out with another group. They gave me a girl who''d started that week. What''s the point of booking?', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'high', 'Course says they were short on the day. Told the reporter.', '2026-08-03 19:51:34+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_caddy_20260916', '2026-08-02 10:37:33+07', '2026-08-03 19:57:34+07');
